<section class="gg-clean-hero">
  <div class="gg-clean-bg"></div>

  <div class="gg-container gg-clean-hero-grid">
    <div class="gg-clean-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower App</span>

      <h1>A garden for the life you're trying to build.</h1>

      <p>
        Goal Grower turns habits and big goals into living plants, so progress
        feels visible, personal, and easier to return to.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
        <a href="#demo" class="gg-btn-soft">Watch Demo</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-clean-phone-scene reveal">
      <div class="gg-clean-note note-a">
        <strong>Return</strong>
        <span>without shame</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-clean-note note-b">
        <strong>Grow</strong>
        <span>one action at a time</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-clean-phone main-clean-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '1000x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-clean-phone side-clean-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker small"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '700x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower goals list screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-clean-section gg-promise-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-promise-card reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The promise</span>
      <h2>Less pressure. More return.</h2>
      <p>
        Most productivity tools make progress feel like performance. Goal Grower
        makes it feel like care — something alive that you can come back to.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-clean-section gg-app-flow-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">How it works</span>
      <h2>The app has one simple rhythm.</h2>
      <p>Start with space, choose what matters, then watch the goal grow.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-clean-flow-grid">
      <article class="gg-clean-flow-card reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="gg-flow-number">01</span>
          <h3>Start fresh</h3>
          <p>Begin with a quiet space for your goals to take shape.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-clean-phone flow-clean-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-no-goals-yet.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'No goals yet screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-clean-flow-card reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="gg-flow-number">02</span>
          <h3>Choose your goals</h3>
          <p>Keep the goals you care about visible and easy to return to.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-clean-phone flow-clean-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal list screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-clean-flow-card reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="gg-flow-number">03</span>
          <h3>Grow the garden</h3>
          <p>Your effort becomes visible through plants and progress.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-clean-phone flow-clean-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-clean-section gg-demo-section" id="demo">
  <div class="gg-container gg-demo-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Demo</span>
      <h2>See the app in motion.</h2>
      <p>
        A quick runthrough of the real Goal Grower experience, shown inside the
        same phone frame as the screenshots.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-clean-phone demo-clean-phone reveal">
      <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
      <div class="gg-phone-screen">
        <video
          src="{{ 'Screen_Recording_goal-grower-runthrough.mp4' | asset_url }}"
          autoplay
          muted
          loop
          playsinline
          preload="metadata"
        ></video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-clean-section gg-proof-section">
  <div class="gg-container gg-proof-grid">
    <div class="gg-clean-phone proof-clean-phone reveal">
      <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
      <div class="gg-phone-screen">
        {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Structure underneath</span>
      <h2>Emotional progress still needs clear details.</h2>
      <p>
        The garden makes the goal feel alive. The details screen keeps it grounded,
        measurable, and understandable.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-clean-section gg-shared-clean-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-shared-clean-card reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="gg-kicker">Shared gardens</span>
        <h2>Grow with people who are growing too.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Create shared gardens with friends, spouses, classmates, roommates, or
          accountability partners. Everyone works on their own goals while
          contributing to something together.
        </p>

        <div class="gg-pills">
          <span>Friends</span>
          <span>Family</span>
          <span>Classmates</span>
          <span>Partners</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-clean-section gg-support-clean-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support the build</span>
      <h2>Help the garden keep growing.</h2>
      <p>
        Support development, testing, future apps, digital tools, and products
        made for intentional growth.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-support-clean-grid">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-support-clean-card reveal">
        <span>Main</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower Support</h3>
        <p>Help fund development, design, testing, and future features.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-support-clean-card reveal">
        <span>Tools</span>
        <h3>Digital Products</h3>
        <p>Templates, planners, and intentional growth resources.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-support-clean-card reveal">
        <span>Objects</span>
        <h3>Physical Products</h3>
        <p>Merch, desk items, and calming productivity products.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-clean-final">
  <div class="gg-container reveal">
    <span class="gg-kicker">The mission</span>
    <h2>Build a life you can keep returning to.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is about making progress feel human, hopeful, and worth caring about.
    </p>
    <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
  </div>
</section>

